edel gehörig. []\n— 2〉 (*m. f. आ und ई) und. n. der Schweif des Bos grunniens, der als Fliegenwedel gebraucht wird und zu den Insignien eines Fürsten gehört. Auch als Schmuck auf dem Kopfe von Pferden und Elephanten KĀD. 109,17. Am Ende eines adj. Comp. f. आ.\n— 3〉 *n. und f. आ Stiel.\n— 4〉 n. ein best. Metrum.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "चामर II. *m. und अवर˚ m. ein best. Theil der Welt MAHĀVY. 154.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चामरं", "चामरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["cAmaraM", "cAmaraH"]}], "camaraka": [{"id": "camaraka", "headword": "चमरक", "headword_slp1": "camaraka", "fold": "camaraka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*चमरक m. Biene GAL.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "camarapucCa": [{"id": "camarapucCa", "headword": "चमरपुच्छ", "headword_slp1": "camarapucCa", "fold": "camarapucCa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*चमरपुच्छ m. der indische Fuchs RĀJAN. 19,51.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चमरपुच्छः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["camarapucCaH"]}], "camaravala": [{"id": "camaravAla", "headword": "चमरवाल", "headword_slp1": "camaravAla", "fold": "camaravala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "चमरवाल m. N. pr. eines Fürsten.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "camarika": [{"id": "camarika", "headword": "चमरिक", "headword_slp1": "camarika", "fold": "camarika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "चमरिक m. Bauhinia variegata BHĀVAPR. 1,204.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चमरिकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["camarikaH"]}, {"id": "cAmarika", "headword": "चामरिक", "headword_slp1": "cAmarika", "fold": "camarika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*चामरिक m. Fliegenwedel